#Протокол_Schematic_Visualization_View_V1<[
Базис:
  design-schematic-visualization-view описывает sidebar view "Схема" отдельно от architecture L1 map и task dependency graph.
  implement-schematic-visualization-view-mvp реализовал derived schematic.view.v1 в src/schematicView.mjs и UI tab Схема.
Вектор:
  Блоки Work Graph OS: Intent Tree, Work Graph, Runner, Evidence, Project Memory, Graph/RAG, Operator UI, OneBase Domain, Storage/Snapshot.
  Связи typed edges (feeds, uses, validates, maps_to, rebuilds) без work.depends_on.
  MVP renderer: zero-dependency SVG/HTML in workGraphBacklogUiServer; no manual editor.
  Click-through: view:board, view:graph for operational surfaces; detail drawer for protocol paths on other blocks.
Цель:
  Design artifact aligned with shipped MVP; operator sees system loop without reading all protocols.

Проверки:
  определены блоки и связи схемы
  схема отделена от dependency graph задач
  выбран MVP renderer без библиотек
  описаны click-through targets

